# registry-triage.prl — the visible list of parser constructs the
# published specification (Annex A) does not register (kernel rule R1).
# The registry-parity test fails for any parser keyword that is neither
# in Annex A nor marked here, and fails for any entry that has since
# gained a specification section — the list only shrinks.
#
# The list is EMPTY (phase 6 of the reconfiguration, 2026-09-30): the
# thirty-two platform modules were specified in clause 20 (phase 2),
# the two unused constructs were retracted, and the three workflow
# constructs merged into the surviving process dialect and were removed
# from the parser after the migration window (phase 5). Every construct
# of the parser has its normative home in Annex A.
